WEBVTT

01:30.410 --> 01:34.970
[The Heir]

01:35.360 --> 01:37.930
[Episode 29]

01:47.120 --> 01:48.280
Seventh Grandmother.

01:48.280 --> 01:49.430
I think

01:49.509 --> 01:51.479
our Li family
should go to Nanjing and compete

01:51.479 --> 01:55.080
for the commission to supply
the Princess's birthday inkstick.

02:01.710 --> 02:02.840
Zhen.

02:03.610 --> 02:05.560
Then tell me

02:08.080 --> 02:10.910
why we should go.

02:13.240 --> 02:14.470
Seventh Grandmother,

02:14.470 --> 02:16.900
these days,
our ink workshop has finally started

02:16.900 --> 02:18.180
to turn a corner.

02:18.680 --> 02:21.310
Whether in the variety of inks
or in sales,

02:21.470 --> 02:24.079
we can be on par
with the Tian and Chen families.

02:24.960 --> 02:25.800
However,

02:26.240 --> 02:27.560
not to mention Li Ink

02:27.560 --> 02:29.120
at its peak,

02:29.470 --> 02:31.150
even compared to a decade ago

02:31.240 --> 02:33.700
when we were still
a Tribute Ink supplier...

02:34.280 --> 02:35.430
Seventh Grandmother,

02:35.430 --> 02:36.240
are you alright?

02:36.240 --> 02:36.960
I'm fine.

02:37.079 --> 02:38.000
Have some tea.

02:39.590 --> 02:40.150
I'm fine.

02:40.150 --> 02:42.030
Go on. I'm listening.

02:42.520 --> 02:43.310
I was saying,

02:43.510 --> 02:45.270
even compared to a decade ago

02:46.280 --> 02:49.030
when we were still a Tribute Ink supplier,

02:49.120 --> 02:50.450
we are still far behind.

02:51.470 --> 02:52.960
If we limit our vision

02:52.960 --> 02:55.710
to Huizhou and this particular time

02:55.870 --> 02:58.280
and only measure ourselves against
the Tian and Chen families,

02:58.280 --> 03:00.410
then we are still a bit short-sighted,

03:00.560 --> 03:03.800
and we won't be able to move forward.

03:05.730 --> 03:06.760
These days,

03:06.960 --> 03:09.190
I've been dealing
with those traveling merchants.

03:09.190 --> 03:11.800
I found that most of the profits
from the ink

03:11.890 --> 03:14.550
we sell outside Huizhou end up
in their pockets.

03:14.680 --> 03:16.560
If we want the bigger share,

03:16.750 --> 03:17.840
we have to take

03:17.840 --> 03:19.960
the Li Ink name beyond Huizhou.

03:21.079 --> 03:22.210
I've been thinking.

03:22.970 --> 03:25.680
Nanjing is second only
to the Capital in prosperity,

03:25.680 --> 03:27.590
and it's close to Huizhou.

03:28.560 --> 03:30.280
This trip to Nanjing

03:30.310 --> 03:32.110
isn't just for the birthday ink.

03:32.400 --> 03:33.800
I want to check out

03:33.960 --> 03:35.630
what the market there is like.

03:35.910 --> 03:37.190
If the prospects are good

03:37.190 --> 03:38.750
and there's a suitable storefront,

03:38.750 --> 03:41.470
we'll open a Li Ink branch there.

03:41.710 --> 03:43.310
We'll start with Nanjing

03:43.430 --> 03:45.290
and restore Li Ink's reputation.

03:47.079 --> 03:48.030
Good.

03:49.910 --> 03:51.510
But Zhen,

03:52.310 --> 03:55.280
there is always someone better.

03:56.000 --> 03:56.840
Are you...

03:57.630 --> 03:59.190
confident?

04:00.800 --> 04:02.060
Seventh Grandmother,

04:02.430 --> 04:04.310
only by stepping out of Huizhou

04:04.710 --> 04:06.520
can I know how strong others are.

04:08.310 --> 04:10.160
This trip to Nanjing

04:11.120 --> 04:12.920
isn't about taking first place.

04:13.080 --> 04:15.840
It's about seeing a bigger world.

04:16.600 --> 04:18.329
Even if I lose, that's alright.

04:18.630 --> 04:20.600
At least I'll know where I stand

04:21.000 --> 04:22.850
and see the road ahead more clearly,

04:22.850 --> 04:24.240
so I can keep moving forward,

04:24.240 --> 04:25.870
one step at a time,
and lead Li Ink onward.

04:25.870 --> 04:26.950
Don't you agree?

04:29.000 --> 04:30.070
Good.

04:30.750 --> 04:32.430
Very good.

04:34.870 --> 04:36.600
Your plan

04:36.630 --> 04:38.310
gives me

04:39.040 --> 04:41.600
a glimpse of the future.

04:44.360 --> 04:46.360
You have great vision.

04:46.360 --> 04:47.620
Seventh Grandmother.

04:49.120 --> 04:51.750
I'll put you in charge

04:52.430 --> 04:54.680
of this trip to Nanjing.

04:55.310 --> 04:56.430
Seventh Grandmother,

04:56.430 --> 04:57.560
stop teasing me.

04:57.600 --> 04:59.600
It's all because you taught me well.

05:01.430 --> 05:03.830
There's still one thing I'm worried about.

05:04.070 --> 05:04.830
Tell me.

05:05.160 --> 05:06.720
It's a long journey.

05:06.720 --> 05:08.390
I can't feel at ease

05:08.600 --> 05:10.800
with you going to Nanjing alone.

05:10.830 --> 05:13.920
You should pick someone from the family
to go with you,

05:14.040 --> 05:15.840
so you can look after each other.

05:17.480 --> 05:17.680
Mother.

05:17.680 --> 05:18.830
Alright.

05:18.830 --> 05:20.480
To be honest, Seventh Grandmother,

05:20.480 --> 05:22.240
I've already thought it through.

05:22.240 --> 05:24.160
I want to take Zhengshen with me.

05:24.510 --> 05:27.000
He is now very skilled in ink-making,

05:27.360 --> 05:29.000
and he's learned a lot
of woodblock printing techniques

05:29.000 --> 05:31.120
from Third Aunt.

05:31.560 --> 05:32.360
I'm thinking,

05:32.490 --> 05:34.620
since this is for a birthday inkstick,

05:34.680 --> 05:37.630
we naturally need to put some effort
into the woodblock printing.

05:37.630 --> 05:39.600
Zhengshen can help me,

05:39.600 --> 05:42.930
and it'll also give him a chance
to make use of his abilities.

05:43.270 --> 05:43.950
Good.

05:44.270 --> 05:45.070
Good.

05:46.000 --> 05:47.170
Besides him,

05:47.510 --> 05:49.170
I want to take one more person.

05:51.390 --> 05:52.240
Eldest Aunt,

05:52.510 --> 05:54.830
Zhengyou is a promising talent
in ink-making,

05:54.830 --> 05:57.159
and he'll be the pillar
of Li Ink in the future.

05:57.159 --> 05:59.600
I want to take him along to see the world,

06:00.160 --> 06:01.560
letting him see what the finest

06:01.560 --> 06:04.040
and most valuable inks in the world

06:04.040 --> 06:05.190
look like

06:05.390 --> 06:07.650
and experience what makes ink so unique,

06:07.920 --> 06:10.720
so that he will understand
the Way of Ink on his own.

06:10.750 --> 06:12.920
Eldest Aunt, would you agree?

06:14.160 --> 06:15.920
Good, good.

06:17.870 --> 06:19.510
Of course I would.

06:20.920 --> 06:23.190
You've thought of everything for Zhengyou
so carefully.

06:23.190 --> 06:25.190
How can I ever thank you enough?

06:25.240 --> 06:26.430
Eldest Aunt,

06:26.560 --> 06:27.950
don't be so polite to me.

06:30.920 --> 06:33.120
You've never traveled this far before.

06:33.360 --> 06:34.800
It's freezing cold out here.

06:34.800 --> 06:36.000
Your journey

06:36.270 --> 06:38.159
will take more than a month.

06:39.560 --> 06:41.430
You'll need to prepare everything

06:41.430 --> 06:42.950
properly.

06:44.000 --> 06:44.750
Mother.

06:45.070 --> 06:46.800
I won't keep you company here.

06:46.830 --> 06:48.750
I'll go prepare things for them.

06:49.070 --> 06:49.920
Go now.

06:50.600 --> 06:52.930
Don't worry, Eldest Aunt. Take your time.

06:53.870 --> 06:56.860
[Yihousheng]

06:57.220 --> 06:59.550
The Li family's Shize Ink is selling well.

06:59.800 --> 07:01.730
The Tian family's Styrax resin ink

07:01.870 --> 07:04.470
has been forced to drop its market price
by 20%.

07:04.680 --> 07:07.120
They have already suffered
a lot of losses.

07:07.750 --> 07:09.800
They brought this upon themselves.

07:16.270 --> 07:17.000
Master.

07:19.510 --> 07:20.190
Master?

07:26.800 --> 07:29.260
Although overstocking means tying up cash,

07:30.360 --> 07:32.600
there's no need to sell at such a loss.

07:33.480 --> 07:35.830
Maybe they have other moves planned.

07:37.720 --> 07:39.720
Keep a close eye on Tian Benchang.

07:44.830 --> 07:45.510
Master.

07:47.830 --> 07:48.830
We're closed!

07:56.950 --> 07:57.800
Who is it?

08:00.560 --> 08:01.290
Miss Li Zhen?

08:02.120 --> 08:02.780
Have a seat.

08:06.310 --> 08:07.070
What's this?

08:07.600 --> 08:08.630
It's for you.

08:10.480 --> 08:11.340
I was thinking,

08:11.390 --> 08:13.250
since you're back at Yihousheng,

08:13.310 --> 08:15.510
you must have gotten back

08:15.510 --> 08:16.830
your precious silver fox fur coat.

08:16.830 --> 08:18.750
Silver fox fur with a Liuhe hat

08:18.750 --> 08:19.870
is a perfect match.

08:21.600 --> 08:23.460
You shouldn't have spent so much.

08:23.600 --> 08:24.880
It wasn't too expensive.

08:24.880 --> 08:27.480
I think this time,
when we go to Nanjing on business,

08:27.480 --> 08:28.800
dressed like this,

08:28.920 --> 08:32.049
you won't be any worse
than those wealthy young masters.

08:32.630 --> 08:33.720
You said it yourself—

08:33.720 --> 08:36.440
when doing business,
presence matters first.

08:38.870 --> 08:39.909
Go to Nanjing?

08:41.440 --> 08:42.960
Princess Shouyang in Nanjing

08:42.960 --> 08:45.600
is selecting birthday inkstick
for Noble Consort Du.

08:45.600 --> 08:47.150
I've already agreed with Lord Yan

08:47.150 --> 08:48.750
to take part in the selection
on behalf of Li Ink.

08:48.750 --> 08:52.390
There are plenty of nobles
and business opportunities in Nanjing,

08:52.390 --> 08:54.270
so we can take this opportunity

08:54.480 --> 08:56.910
and bring a lot of inventory
from the ink workshop.

08:56.910 --> 08:59.840
Once we get there, we can pick a shop
and open a branch.

09:00.120 --> 09:02.270
We'll work together like before

09:02.320 --> 09:04.510
and happily close a few deals.

09:06.320 --> 09:07.840
Xianglan told me—

09:08.030 --> 09:11.320
there are shops everywhere
on Nanjing's South and North Streets,

09:11.320 --> 09:13.720
and lots of antiques and foreign goods.

09:14.360 --> 09:16.630
You can help me pick some out

09:16.740 --> 09:19.060
to bring back for Seventh Grandmother
and Grandfather

09:19.060 --> 09:20.060
as collectibles.

09:21.200 --> 09:23.550
Of course, in return,

09:23.720 --> 09:26.440
I'll treat you
to Nanjing's lantern festival.

09:27.550 --> 09:29.190
I heard that at Sanshan Hall,

09:29.220 --> 09:30.670
there are countless lanterns,

09:30.670 --> 09:33.120
with all kinds of designs.

09:34.000 --> 09:34.720
So?

09:35.030 --> 09:37.240
Are you happy hearing that?

09:39.670 --> 09:41.080
Sounds great.

09:42.480 --> 09:43.320
But...

09:44.480 --> 09:45.360
I might...

09:47.390 --> 09:48.790
not be able to...

09:49.390 --> 09:50.720
go to Nanjing this time.

09:56.200 --> 09:56.840
Right.

09:57.080 --> 09:59.320
I heard the Japanese
are causing a lot of trouble now.

09:59.320 --> 10:01.080
General Qi is at the front lines,

10:01.080 --> 10:03.080
and things must be extremely tense.

10:03.510 --> 10:04.440
Don't worry.

10:04.550 --> 10:06.480
If this Nanjing trip goes smoothly,

10:06.480 --> 10:08.150
I can give you your share
of the profits early—

10:08.150 --> 10:10.610
before the New Year,
they can reach the army.

10:11.910 --> 10:14.110
It's not just about military supplies.

10:14.440 --> 10:16.240
Now that I'm back at Yihousheng,

10:16.550 --> 10:19.150
it's the critical moment
to get back on my feet.

10:19.510 --> 10:20.440
So...

10:23.320 --> 10:24.520
I really can't leave.

10:28.200 --> 10:29.750
You just returned to Yihousheng,

10:29.750 --> 10:31.950
so of course you have a lot on your plate.

10:33.510 --> 10:36.220
But the trip to Nanjing
will only take a little over a month.

10:36.220 --> 10:38.330
Can't you even spare a month?

10:39.270 --> 10:40.240
I...

10:42.750 --> 10:44.440
may no longer be able to perform

10:44.440 --> 10:45.750
my duties at Li Ink.

10:47.200 --> 10:50.200
Therefore, I am formally resigning
from my position.

10:50.390 --> 10:51.600
Our cooperation

10:53.750 --> 10:54.670
ends here.

10:56.480 --> 10:57.240
Of course,

10:57.550 --> 10:58.880
you don't need to worry.

10:58.980 --> 11:00.980
I have some connections in Nanjing.

11:01.080 --> 11:02.910
I will write a few letters tomorrow

11:02.910 --> 11:04.370
to sort things out for you.

11:05.150 --> 11:06.360
For the past few days,

11:06.720 --> 11:08.520
I want to thank you, Miss Li Zhen,

11:08.670 --> 11:11.000
for your care and consideration.

11:12.150 --> 11:13.080
There's no need.

11:16.790 --> 11:18.390
I was just being impulsive

11:19.200 --> 11:20.460
and talking to myself.

11:24.970 --> 11:27.360
Master Qi, you're a capable man,

11:27.870 --> 11:29.390
and a free-spirited one at that.

11:29.390 --> 11:31.120
I shouldn't keep you tied down.

11:31.480 --> 11:33.610
Consider this Liuhe hat a gift from me,

11:34.120 --> 11:36.920
to congratulate you
on your return to Yihousheng.

11:38.030 --> 11:40.030
I wish you

11:40.510 --> 11:41.630
a bright

11:42.390 --> 11:43.650
and boundless future.

11:45.030 --> 11:46.030
I'll be going now.

11:47.390 --> 11:48.520
No need to see me out.

12:08.290 --> 12:13.600
♪ Candlelight sways,
I swallow sorrow alone ♪

12:17.030 --> 12:22.440
♪ I write each word in slow,
desolate tone ♪

12:24.840 --> 12:29.210
♪ Looking back,
the road stretches on and on ♪

12:29.570 --> 12:33.850
♪ Still unhurt,
I drink another grief with the moon ♪

12:34.060 --> 12:41.600
♪ I carve past years' bonds
into the scroll of time ♪

12:42.080 --> 12:46.340
♪ Please turn the light
that waits in the dark ♪

12:46.490 --> 12:50.350
♪ Into a new direction
after wind and frost ♪

12:50.950 --> 12:54.980
♪ Trust keeps the heart calm ♪

12:55.480 --> 12:59.350
♪ And unconfused ♪

12:59.670 --> 13:04.090
♪ Please let the girl I might meet again ♪

13:04.450 --> 13:08.590
♪ Be hope that fate has gently given ♪

13:08.830 --> 13:12.350
♪ No matter how many regrets remain ♪

13:13.300 --> 13:15.980
♪ In the end, all has already passed ♪

13:19.000 --> 13:19.750
Zhen.

13:23.910 --> 13:24.790
Xianglan.

13:26.730 --> 13:29.890
Logically speaking,
Master Qi returning to Yihousheng

13:30.440 --> 13:32.110
should make me happy.

13:32.870 --> 13:34.080
But for some reason,

13:34.910 --> 13:36.750
ever since he left Li Ink,

13:37.390 --> 13:39.270
I've been feeling depressed.

13:44.960 --> 13:46.360
According to the book,

13:47.390 --> 13:50.440
"The east wind blows
and pear blossoms bloom,

13:51.510 --> 13:55.080
and the lovesickness grows
stronger by the day."

13:56.140 --> 13:58.810
It stands to reason that lovesickness

13:59.030 --> 14:01.720
usually happens in spring
when the pear blossoms are in bloom.

14:01.720 --> 14:03.030
How come our Zhen

14:03.080 --> 14:06.150
is already so full of sorrow
for love in the winter?

14:06.720 --> 14:08.580
I'm telling you my true feelings,

14:08.870 --> 14:10.400
and you're making fun of me.

14:13.150 --> 14:15.750
Xianglan, am I being too selfish?

14:16.000 --> 14:17.240
Because Master Qi

14:17.960 --> 14:20.120
is efficient,

14:20.320 --> 14:21.960
helpful in everything,

14:22.600 --> 14:24.720
and has always been by my side
taking care of me,

14:24.720 --> 14:26.840
I just want to keep him

14:26.840 --> 14:28.200
tied to me.

14:30.790 --> 14:34.190
There are so many people
coming and going in the ink workshop.

14:34.200 --> 14:36.630
He's not the only one
who can get things done.

14:36.630 --> 14:39.790
Would others' leaving

14:40.600 --> 14:43.630
also make you feel so depressed?

14:48.630 --> 14:49.720
I don't know.

14:51.910 --> 14:53.510
Stop sighing.

14:53.840 --> 14:54.320
You...

14:55.600 --> 14:56.870
We don't know

14:56.960 --> 14:58.270
what he thinks,

14:58.320 --> 15:00.910
and we don't need to bother
figuring it out.

15:01.000 --> 15:03.360
The point is what you think.

15:03.390 --> 15:05.790
You haven't even sorted out
your own feelings.

15:05.790 --> 15:08.240
Aren't you just asking for trouble here?

15:10.630 --> 15:11.390
I...

15:14.120 --> 15:14.750
Right.

15:15.080 --> 15:17.840
Just so happens you're going to Nanjing

15:18.870 --> 15:21.240
for about a month.

15:22.150 --> 15:23.720
If you get there

15:23.960 --> 15:25.600
and forget all about

15:25.670 --> 15:28.600
Master Qi or whoever completely,

15:29.230 --> 15:31.750
then you can't say you like him.

15:32.090 --> 15:33.810
So you're only upset now

15:33.840 --> 15:37.470
because you're not used to him
not being around.

15:37.960 --> 15:38.720
However,

15:39.050 --> 15:40.360
If you get there

15:40.390 --> 15:42.450
and just jot down everything you see—

15:42.480 --> 15:44.360
good food, fun things,

15:44.390 --> 15:46.510
and anything new and interesting,

15:46.550 --> 15:48.960
wanting to tell him all about it
in detail when you get back,

15:48.960 --> 15:50.160
then you're done for.

15:50.870 --> 15:52.470
You won't be able to get away.

15:52.630 --> 15:53.790
Because he's

15:54.790 --> 15:57.080
already in your heart.

15:59.390 --> 16:01.120
Who did you learn all this from?

16:02.440 --> 16:03.960
I read it in storybooks.

16:07.630 --> 16:09.750
I'm going to Nanjing
for something serious—

16:09.750 --> 16:11.200
the birthday inkstick competition.

16:11.200 --> 16:12.910
I won't have time to have fun.

16:13.080 --> 16:14.240
Besides, Nanjing is huge,

16:14.240 --> 16:15.790
and I've never been there before.

16:15.790 --> 16:17.200
I don't even know the roads,

16:17.200 --> 16:18.840
and I don't know where anywhere is.

16:18.840 --> 16:19.870
Are you stupid?

16:20.150 --> 16:21.480
I know Nanjing well.

16:21.600 --> 16:22.360
Just wait.

16:22.360 --> 16:25.030
I'll go beg my father
to let me go with you.

16:25.030 --> 16:25.840
Really?

16:26.550 --> 16:27.480
It's a deal.

16:29.030 --> 16:29.840
Deal.

16:59.440 --> 17:01.150
A letter came from the Capital today.

17:01.150 --> 17:02.080
Take a look.

17:17.790 --> 17:18.589
Great.

17:20.200 --> 17:21.720
This Qing He

17:23.000 --> 17:25.060
has finally gotten what he deserves.

17:25.720 --> 17:27.119
The censors took the lead

17:27.230 --> 17:30.680
and reported several cases
to the Administrative Department.

17:30.680 --> 17:33.030
Even if His Majesty favors him,

17:33.440 --> 17:35.920
he still has to take court opinion
into account.

17:35.920 --> 17:39.120
I heard he hasn't been granted
an audience for a month now.

17:40.240 --> 17:41.310
At this rate,

17:41.790 --> 17:43.070
it won't be long

17:43.640 --> 17:46.790
before he's abandoned by His Majesty.

17:47.030 --> 17:49.830
By then, the Tian family
will have no backing left.

17:53.110 --> 17:57.030
The fly has finally landed
on Qing He's head.

17:58.730 --> 18:01.240
The Tian family has benefited
from currying favor with the powerful,

18:01.240 --> 18:02.880
so they'll surely
try the same tactics again.

18:02.880 --> 18:03.830
I heard

18:04.030 --> 18:07.110
Tian Benchang is participating
in the princess's ink selection

18:07.110 --> 18:09.200
precisely to curry favor
with Princess Shouyang.

18:09.200 --> 18:10.400
Rest assured, Sister.

18:10.400 --> 18:13.530
When it comes to making ink,
Miss Li Zhen will never lose.

18:14.400 --> 18:17.240
But Tian Benchang's actions
are suspicious.

18:18.240 --> 18:19.900
Every family going to Nanjing

18:20.160 --> 18:22.030
would normally bring
extra high-quality ink

18:22.030 --> 18:23.070
to sell.

18:23.480 --> 18:24.720
But he instead cleared out

18:24.720 --> 18:27.110
all his stored Styrax resin ink

18:27.160 --> 18:28.560
at a low price in advance.

18:28.920 --> 18:30.320
For this trip to Nanjing,

18:30.640 --> 18:33.770
he's actually bringing
over a thousand taels of silver.

18:37.160 --> 18:38.110
I see.

18:38.310 --> 18:39.970
Qing He is falling from grace.

18:40.550 --> 18:42.030
He's going to Nanjing

18:42.880 --> 18:45.280
to curry favor with more powerful figures.

18:45.830 --> 18:46.510
Sister.

18:47.680 --> 18:48.960
I have to go to Nanjing.

18:49.510 --> 18:50.790
I want to investigate what Tian Benchang

18:50.790 --> 18:51.750
is really up to.

18:51.920 --> 18:54.590
Zhen, this is Sanshan Street.

18:52.420 --> 18:57.160
[Nanjing]

18:54.590 --> 18:57.440
It's like Sibao Street in our Huizhou.

18:57.680 --> 18:59.270
Is this the busiest street here?

18:59.270 --> 18:59.880
Yes.

19:01.400 --> 19:02.960
My Lady, look over there.

19:02.960 --> 19:04.000
L-Let me take a look at this.

19:04.000 --> 19:05.640
You can look around yourself.

19:05.640 --> 19:06.680
Go on.

19:08.920 --> 19:09.520
Zhengyou.

19:09.720 --> 19:10.960
Look, ink.

19:15.110 --> 19:16.830
What kinds of ink do you have here?

19:16.830 --> 19:17.640
I have all the famous brands.

19:17.640 --> 19:18.310
All the famous brands?

19:18.310 --> 19:19.000
Yes.

19:19.880 --> 19:22.480
Do you have ink from the Li family
of Huizhou?

19:22.550 --> 19:23.440
Li family?

19:24.110 --> 19:24.920
I really do.

19:24.940 --> 19:25.770
Look.

19:29.790 --> 19:31.000
Zhengyou, they really do.

19:31.000 --> 19:31.720
Look.

19:34.750 --> 19:35.350
Miss,

19:35.550 --> 19:37.030
do you want some Ejiao cake?

19:37.030 --> 19:39.000
Ma'am, can I have a taste?

19:39.030 --> 19:39.790
Sure.

19:40.550 --> 19:41.160
Here.

19:41.310 --> 19:42.400
Please try it.

19:42.480 --> 19:43.880
This is our new product,

19:43.960 --> 19:45.030
Rose Ejiao cake.

19:45.030 --> 19:46.090
Is it good, My Lady?

19:47.350 --> 19:48.070
It's good.

19:48.240 --> 19:49.000
Not bad.

19:49.240 --> 19:51.030
This Ejiao cake is really delicious.

19:51.030 --> 19:52.290
And it's easy to carry.

19:52.440 --> 19:53.880
Let's buy two boxes for Zhen.

19:53.880 --> 19:54.480
Okay.

19:55.240 --> 19:55.830
Here.

19:56.720 --> 19:57.440
Alright.

19:57.510 --> 19:58.160
Two boxes.

19:58.160 --> 19:59.160
Just give it to me.

19:59.750 --> 20:00.330
Thank you.

20:00.330 --> 20:01.260
You're welcome.

20:02.000 --> 20:03.000
Here, take it.

20:03.400 --> 20:04.070
Alright.

20:05.110 --> 20:06.170
Thank you, My Lady.

20:06.480 --> 20:07.810
It's really delicious.

20:08.070 --> 20:12.230
[Princess Shouyang's Mansion]

20:25.000 --> 20:25.920
Zhengyou.

20:26.070 --> 20:27.310
The shape of qin?

20:27.880 --> 20:28.680
Quite novel.

20:31.920 --> 20:32.550
Zhengyou,

20:32.900 --> 20:34.550
this is the ink from the Wang family
of Xiuning,

20:34.550 --> 20:35.830
Millennium Ink.

20:36.480 --> 20:38.960
The Xiuning school
is known for its ornate style

20:38.960 --> 20:41.220
and its skillful use of gold decoration.

20:41.830 --> 20:42.960
And look,

20:43.000 --> 20:45.160
isn't the gold lacquer on it beautiful?

20:43.040 --> 20:44.540
[Pine Wind, Frost, Millennium,
Taisu, Shuiyue, Qinggui]

20:45.790 --> 20:48.000
This set of assorted inks
and multiple inksticks

20:48.000 --> 20:49.790
can actually be used as gifts.

20:53.030 --> 20:54.160
Ten Views of Qiantang?

20:54.160 --> 20:56.090
This is the Lin family of Qiantang.

20:56.170 --> 20:58.200
Do you know what they are best at?

20:59.240 --> 21:00.200
Woodblock printing?

21:00.200 --> 21:00.790
Yes.

21:01.030 --> 21:02.920
All kinds of figures, landscapes,
and story scenes—

21:02.920 --> 21:04.320
don't they have them all?

21:04.720 --> 21:06.750
And their family's
woodblock printing techniques

21:06.750 --> 21:08.240
are passed down
from generation to generation,

21:08.240 --> 21:10.440
just like our Li family's

21:10.440 --> 21:11.480
pine soot ink.

21:13.720 --> 21:14.590
Makes sense.

21:14.750 --> 21:15.790
Makes sense.

21:18.350 --> 21:20.950
Isn't this Qi Chun,
one of the Five Ink-making Grandmasters?

21:20.950 --> 21:23.120
He was just appointed as Supervisor
of the Directorate of Imperial Supplies.

21:23.120 --> 21:24.410
What is he doing here?

21:24.440 --> 21:26.830
Today's banquet is probably not simple.

21:26.830 --> 21:27.510
He's coming.

21:27.510 --> 21:28.240
Stop talking.

21:28.240 --> 21:28.830
Lord Qi.

21:28.830 --> 21:29.550
My Lord.

21:29.550 --> 21:30.270
Hello.

21:30.680 --> 21:31.440
Lord Qi.

21:31.440 --> 21:32.430
Greetings, Lord Qi.

21:32.430 --> 21:34.000
Hello, everyone.

21:41.830 --> 21:42.830
Ronghua?

21:46.720 --> 21:47.680
Ronghua?

21:50.030 --> 21:50.750
Ronghua,

21:51.110 --> 21:52.310
how have you been lately?

21:52.310 --> 21:54.570
Did you receive the letter I wrote to you?

21:55.180 --> 21:57.980
[Qi Chun, Supervisor
of Directorate of Imperial Supplies]

21:59.350 --> 22:01.160
The Princess has arrived!

22:18.820 --> 22:20.900
Greetings, Your Highness.

22:24.640 --> 22:25.750
Rise, everyone.

22:26.030 --> 22:28.350
Thank you, Your Highness.

22:29.750 --> 22:31.350
Supervisor Qi, you're here too?

22:29.820 --> 22:31.490
[Princess Shouyang]

22:33.160 --> 22:35.240
Blessings to Your Highness.

22:36.780 --> 22:39.130
I, Tian Ronghua, greet Your Highness.

22:39.610 --> 22:41.160
The Tian family of She County is honored

22:41.160 --> 22:43.000
to have invited Supervisor Qi

22:43.000 --> 22:45.640
to represent Tian Ink in Princess's Mansion's
birthday inkstick selection.

22:45.640 --> 22:48.070
We will definitely do our best
to present good ink

22:48.070 --> 22:50.530
to celebrate the Noble Consort's birthday.

22:51.510 --> 22:52.960
Tian Ronghua?

22:54.830 --> 22:55.640
While in the Capital,

22:55.640 --> 22:58.200
I seem to have heard Xu Wan
mention your name.

22:58.400 --> 23:00.030
Aunt Wan also often tells me

23:00.030 --> 23:02.090
about Your Highness's filial piety.

23:02.110 --> 23:03.510
I am deeply touched.

23:03.790 --> 23:05.110
Being able to meet Your Highness today

23:05.110 --> 23:06.640
is truly my blessing.

23:06.960 --> 23:09.240
There will be a banquet
in the mansion later.

23:09.240 --> 23:10.830
You should stay and join us.

23:11.830 --> 23:13.290
Thank you, Your Highness.

23:14.750 --> 23:15.880
Your Highness,

23:16.110 --> 23:18.640
the preliminary ink submissions from
all the ink workshops have been presented.

23:18.640 --> 23:19.920
Please proceed.

24:10.350 --> 24:11.610
They are all very good.

24:13.360 --> 24:14.960
But they are not good enough.

24:17.740 --> 24:20.400
For my mother's birthday inkstick,
I do not want

24:21.780 --> 24:24.040
these so-called precious inks,

24:24.680 --> 24:28.550
nor Buddhist or longevity-themed inks
that are all show and no substance.

24:28.550 --> 24:30.790
What I want must be unique in every way,

24:31.430 --> 24:33.070
inside and out.

24:33.550 --> 24:36.720
It must reflect my mother's character
and temperament,

24:37.030 --> 24:39.830
while still retaining the dignity
of the royal family.

24:39.830 --> 24:41.630
Therefore, I will give all of you

24:41.880 --> 24:43.750
one month.

24:44.550 --> 24:46.680
After one month, bring me your new inks

24:46.790 --> 24:48.640
for my personal evaluation.

24:49.070 --> 24:50.510
Whoever is chosen

24:50.790 --> 24:52.490
will also be granted
3 years of Ink Supplier authority

24:52.490 --> 24:54.200
for the Princess's Mansion.

24:56.870 --> 25:00.550
I hope all the ink-making families here
weigh this carefully,

25:01.270 --> 25:02.960
and do not disappoint me.

25:10.440 --> 25:11.240
Zhengyou.

25:11.790 --> 25:13.070
You go up and wait for me.

25:13.070 --> 25:15.000
I want to wait for Ronghua here.

25:15.030 --> 25:15.550
Okay.

25:15.550 --> 25:16.110
Go ahead.

25:33.160 --> 25:34.240
They say you are

25:34.480 --> 25:36.480
the granddaughter of Li the Eighth.

25:38.440 --> 25:41.270
Why isn't he here in person?

25:41.940 --> 25:43.680
My grandfather
hasn't been feeling well lately.

25:43.680 --> 25:44.590
Besides,

25:44.960 --> 25:46.960
after he made that Teeth-etched Oath
years ago,

25:46.960 --> 25:48.490
he has never made ink again.

25:49.790 --> 25:50.880
Old stubborn fool.

25:52.350 --> 25:53.990
I thought I could finally compete with him

25:53.990 --> 25:55.340
in person this time.

25:55.550 --> 25:59.200
Unexpectedly,
the Li family sent a girl here.

26:00.240 --> 26:02.440
It seems they really have no successor.

26:03.000 --> 26:04.310
I may be young,

26:05.080 --> 26:07.320
but my ink-making skills

26:07.350 --> 26:09.640
were personally taught by my grandfather.

26:09.640 --> 26:11.970
I learned the orthodox Li Ink techniques.

26:12.270 --> 26:13.920
Just now, you didn't even

26:13.920 --> 26:15.780
take a close look at the ink I made.

26:15.820 --> 26:18.420
Isn't that a bit too hasty a judgment?

26:19.200 --> 26:21.110
Your ancient lacquer-soot ink
is indeed good.

26:21.110 --> 26:24.590
Reprocessed ink—
it shows some clever ideas.

26:24.720 --> 26:26.250
At your age, it's quite rare

26:26.350 --> 26:29.030
to have such ink-making skills.

26:30.240 --> 26:31.640
But if you want to beat me,

26:31.920 --> 26:33.510
you'll need a few more years.

26:33.510 --> 26:35.960
Go back quickly and ask Li the Eighth

26:36.640 --> 26:37.790
to help you out.

26:38.720 --> 26:40.400
Thank you for your comments.

26:41.160 --> 26:43.750
But I am the manager of Li Ink,

26:44.240 --> 26:46.960
so it's only right for me
to represent Li Ink.

26:48.160 --> 26:49.200
Rest assured.

26:49.440 --> 26:52.240
I will definitely make ink that
lives up to Li Ink's highest standards.

26:52.240 --> 26:55.110
By then,
I'll compete with you fair and square.

27:07.000 --> 27:07.750
Ronghua.

27:09.880 --> 27:10.550
Ronghua.

27:11.240 --> 27:11.590
Ronghua...

27:11.590 --> 27:12.310
Manager Li,

27:12.640 --> 27:14.200
our lady left you a message.

27:15.680 --> 27:16.680
She said that

27:16.830 --> 27:18.960
once two people make certain choices,

27:18.960 --> 27:20.890
they are no longer on the same path.

27:21.440 --> 27:23.790
Now she is a noble lady in the capital,

27:23.920 --> 27:25.750
while you are just a merchant
and an ink-maker,

27:25.750 --> 27:27.270
and also a competitor.

27:27.640 --> 27:29.270
Don't mention the past anymore,

27:29.270 --> 27:31.870
and there's no need to meet again
in the future.

27:51.030 --> 27:53.240
Ronghua, you're finally back.

27:53.830 --> 27:55.490
What are you doing in Nanjing?

27:55.790 --> 27:57.550
Let me take a good look at you.

27:58.000 --> 27:59.730
Where did this fairy come from?

28:00.550 --> 28:01.350
Those who know you

28:01.350 --> 28:03.480
would recognize you as the eldest lady
of Tian Ink Workshop.

28:03.480 --> 28:04.310
Those who don't

28:04.310 --> 28:06.440
might mistake you for a princess.

28:07.400 --> 28:08.200
Come, Sister.

28:08.550 --> 28:09.270
Have a seat.

28:09.750 --> 28:10.510
Have a seat.

28:10.750 --> 28:11.960
Sit down.

28:12.070 --> 28:13.400
Come on, my good sister.

28:15.920 --> 28:17.350
Regarding the Princess's household's
birthday inkstick,

28:17.350 --> 28:19.640
I've already asked Supervisor Qi
to represent Tian Ink in the selection.

28:19.640 --> 28:21.440
You don't need to worry about it.

28:23.350 --> 28:26.510
You were able to invite Qi Chun,
one of the Five Ink-making Grandmasters.

28:26.510 --> 28:28.840
Of course there's nothing to worry about.

28:29.070 --> 28:30.640
But as the manager of Tian Ink,

28:30.640 --> 28:32.240
how can I stay out of it?

28:32.830 --> 28:35.010
Besides, Sage Qing He has recently

28:35.110 --> 28:37.030
been in a lot of trouble in the Capital.

28:37.030 --> 28:39.590
I came to Nanjing to find more connections

28:39.680 --> 28:41.550
so we won't be implicated
by him in the future.

28:41.550 --> 28:44.280
How dare you keep chasing
powerful connections?

28:44.590 --> 28:46.520
Tian Benchang, let me ask you this.

28:46.970 --> 28:48.150
I had already suppressed

28:48.150 --> 28:49.790
the matter of Sage Qing He

28:49.880 --> 28:51.310
demanding top-grade pine soot ink.

28:51.310 --> 28:53.030
Why did you reopen it?

28:53.070 --> 28:55.240
Just to seize Sixth Master Li's
pine timber

28:55.240 --> 28:57.000
and humiliate the Li family.

28:57.400 --> 28:59.640
You act on your own and ignore all advice.

28:59.640 --> 29:00.790
When the reckoning comes,

29:00.790 --> 29:02.590
I'd like to see how you handle it.

29:03.880 --> 29:05.140
You are right, Sister.

29:06.200 --> 29:07.160
But Ronghua,

29:07.920 --> 29:10.270
you invited this trouble back yourself.

29:10.510 --> 29:12.110
I'm just dealing with it for you.

29:12.110 --> 29:13.480
You can't blame me.

29:15.550 --> 29:16.920
Since things have come to this,

29:16.920 --> 29:18.920
we should be of one mind

29:18.960 --> 29:21.690
to preserve the reputation
of Tian Ink Workshop.

29:22.310 --> 29:25.720
I heard Princess's Mansion
is hosting a banquet today.

29:25.830 --> 29:28.090
Nobles and dignitaries are all invited.

29:28.270 --> 29:31.130
You should take this chance
to introduce me to them.

29:31.400 --> 29:32.400
Getting to know more people

29:32.400 --> 29:34.440
is always good for our Tian family.

29:34.480 --> 29:35.440
Don't you agree?

29:38.030 --> 29:39.830
Sister, have some tea.

29:40.920 --> 29:41.640
Sister.

29:41.640 --> 29:42.640
My good sister.

29:42.960 --> 29:43.510
Come on.

29:43.830 --> 29:44.640
Have some tea.

29:45.720 --> 29:47.640
Take me with you.

29:48.240 --> 29:49.030
Alright?

29:54.070 --> 29:55.670
Then you can go with me later.

29:56.960 --> 29:58.110
Thank you, Sister.

29:58.310 --> 29:58.920
Here.

29:59.350 --> 30:00.270
Have some tea.

30:11.200 --> 30:11.960
Waiter!

30:12.640 --> 30:13.590
Bring another pot of tea!

30:13.590 --> 30:14.350
Coming!

30:16.270 --> 30:17.000
Master.

30:17.790 --> 30:19.650
Didn't Miss Li Zhen give you a hat?

30:19.880 --> 30:21.720
That hat looked quite warm.

30:22.440 --> 30:24.200
It's so cold in Nanjing.

30:24.530 --> 30:25.990
Why are you not wearing it?

30:26.880 --> 30:29.200
You really have a knack
for bringing up the wrong topic.

30:29.200 --> 30:30.930
What does it have to do with you?

30:32.680 --> 30:34.720
In this birthday inkstick selection,

30:34.720 --> 30:37.180
I heard Tian Ronghua
invited Qi Chun to help.

30:37.700 --> 30:40.030
Miss Li Zhen's chances of winning
are really slim.

30:40.030 --> 30:41.480
Should we help her?

30:46.270 --> 30:48.470
Let's just mind our own business first.

30:56.030 --> 30:58.270
Tian Benchang has booked the restaurant
these past few days,

30:58.270 --> 30:59.870
hosting banquets every day.

31:00.000 --> 31:01.510
In the Six Ministries of Nanjing,

31:01.510 --> 31:04.840
there are dandies
from the Ministries of Rites, Personnel,

31:05.000 --> 31:07.330
Revenue, and Works associating with him.

31:07.620 --> 31:10.960
If Tian Benchang only wanted to win
the birthday inkstick selection,

31:10.960 --> 31:13.020
he wouldn't have spent so much money.

31:15.550 --> 31:16.920
So Tian Benchang definitely

31:16.920 --> 31:19.110
isn't doing this just for

31:19.110 --> 31:20.960
Princess's Mansion's ink contract.

31:20.960 --> 31:22.720
He must have other plans.

31:23.510 --> 31:25.240
Keep a close eye on him these days,

31:25.240 --> 31:27.100
in case he pulls any dirty tricks.

31:27.240 --> 31:28.070
Understood.

31:28.960 --> 31:30.750
Watch your step, Young Master.

31:30.750 --> 31:31.480
He's out.

31:33.310 --> 31:35.200
Did you enjoy yourself today?

31:35.350 --> 31:36.110
I did.

31:36.110 --> 31:37.240
Quite enjoyable indeed.

31:37.240 --> 31:39.160
As expected of the Tian family's manager—

31:39.160 --> 31:40.830
so generous today.

31:41.640 --> 31:44.720
If you ever need anything in the future,
just say the word.

31:44.720 --> 31:46.120
Thank you, Young Master.

31:46.310 --> 31:48.440
We'll have plenty of time ahead of us.

31:48.680 --> 31:49.510
-Alright.
-Alright.

31:49.510 --> 31:50.480
We'll have plenty of time ahead of us.

31:50.480 --> 31:51.270
Definitely.

31:51.350 --> 31:52.030
Take care.

31:52.110 --> 31:52.720
Take care!

31:52.720 --> 31:53.440
Let's go.

31:53.480 --> 31:54.790
There's a newly opened tavern over there.

31:54.790 --> 31:55.200
Let's go and...

31:55.200 --> 31:55.730
This way.

32:02.270 --> 32:03.000
Xiao Qi.

32:03.920 --> 32:05.550
He's gone. Follow him.

32:05.830 --> 32:06.590
Be sharp.

33:02.880 --> 33:04.070
I'm freezing.

33:05.790 --> 33:06.720
Is it cold outside?

33:06.720 --> 33:07.240
Yes.

33:07.240 --> 33:08.570
Come inside and warm up.

33:10.790 --> 33:13.090
How is your birthday inkstick
coming along?

33:13.090 --> 33:14.640
The Noble Consort is devoted to Buddhism,

33:14.640 --> 33:15.750
so I was thinking,

33:16.070 --> 33:18.200
I could add some sandalwood to the ink.

33:19.680 --> 33:22.680
Is fragrance also taken into account
when making ink?

33:22.680 --> 33:23.750
So delicate?

33:23.880 --> 33:24.960
Of course.

33:24.960 --> 33:26.590
Since this ink
is made for the Noble Consort,

33:26.590 --> 33:27.680
we must pay attention to every detail

33:27.680 --> 33:28.720
and also think outside the box.

33:28.720 --> 33:30.980
There are a lot of particulars involved.

33:31.000 --> 33:33.720
However, adding sandalwood to the ink,

33:33.720 --> 33:36.270
I'm afraid other families
will also think of this method.

33:36.270 --> 33:37.550
It's still too simple.

33:38.550 --> 33:39.920
I need to think about it.

33:43.110 --> 33:43.790
Zhen.

33:44.400 --> 33:46.070
Let me tell you some good news.

33:46.270 --> 33:48.200
Today, I heard from outside

33:48.350 --> 33:51.400
that the Princess's birth mother,
Noble Consort Du,

33:51.440 --> 33:54.160
is acquainted with Zen Master Fahui
of Luoxia Temple.

33:54.160 --> 33:59.270
She once went there to copy scriptures,
worship Buddha, and pray for blessings,

33:59.350 --> 34:01.200
and even left behind her own calligraphy.

34:01.200 --> 34:03.510
Once I've arranged everything
in the next few days,

34:03.510 --> 34:05.240
let's go to the temple together

34:05.310 --> 34:06.960
and meet Zen Master Fahui.

34:07.000 --> 34:08.280
We can ask him to show you

34:08.280 --> 34:11.030
the Noble Consort's authentic handwriting.
How about that?

34:11.030 --> 34:12.480
That would be wonderful.

34:12.530 --> 34:14.670
If we can see the Noble Consort's
calligraphy with our own eyes,

34:14.670 --> 34:16.800
we will know her habits of using ink.

34:17.550 --> 34:19.400
Zhen, you

34:19.480 --> 34:21.320
have top-notch ink-making skills.

34:21.320 --> 34:22.070
And I

34:22.320 --> 34:24.630
am observant and alert.

34:24.800 --> 34:27.510
We are a powerful combination.

34:27.510 --> 34:29.630
There is nothing we cannot do!

34:30.440 --> 34:32.840
Zhen, I've sorted out everything

34:32.840 --> 34:33.630
to be sent back to Huizhou.

34:33.630 --> 34:34.760
Come and take a look.

34:35.070 --> 34:35.840
Coming.

34:35.840 --> 34:36.370
Let's go.

34:38.920 --> 34:39.920
So many things?

34:39.920 --> 34:40.630
Zhen.

34:40.710 --> 34:42.400
See if anything is missing.

34:42.400 --> 34:42.760
Okay.

34:42.760 --> 34:44.000
I will send them out before dark.

34:44.000 --> 34:44.400
It should arrive in a few days.

34:44.400 --> 34:45.670
This is from Heyuan.

34:46.400 --> 34:47.480
This is also from Heyuan, right?

34:47.480 --> 34:48.030
Yes.

34:48.480 --> 34:49.360
These...

34:49.960 --> 34:51.800
These three are for Seventh Grandmother.

34:51.800 --> 34:52.510
Tea.

34:52.880 --> 34:53.280
Okay.

34:53.440 --> 34:54.000
Yes.

34:54.150 --> 34:56.230
This is a blanket for Uncle Jingdong
to keep his legs warm.

34:56.230 --> 34:57.280
And the silk underneath

34:57.280 --> 34:59.280
is for Eldest Aunt and Third Auntie.

35:00.840 --> 35:02.710
New Li Ink Workshop. Let me see.

35:05.190 --> 35:05.920
That's wrong.

35:05.920 --> 35:07.150
This is for the New Li Ink.

35:07.150 --> 35:07.760
Swap it.

35:07.760 --> 35:08.110
Okay.

35:08.110 --> 35:09.110
This is for Li Ink.

35:10.800 --> 35:12.000
Yes, this is from City Gate Lane.

35:12.000 --> 35:13.710
My grandfather's lung medicine.

35:13.710 --> 35:14.840
This is also from City Gate Lane?

35:14.840 --> 35:15.230
Yes.

35:15.320 --> 35:17.230
It's a hand warmer for my mother.

35:17.510 --> 35:19.590
These are toys for my future nephew.

35:20.360 --> 35:21.320
This is fun.

35:21.400 --> 35:22.190
Yes.

35:22.710 --> 35:23.480
That's all.

35:25.190 --> 35:26.880
Then where is this for?

35:28.360 --> 35:30.150
This is for Yihousheng.

35:31.360 --> 35:32.280
What is it?

35:33.800 --> 35:34.510
Nothing,

35:34.510 --> 35:35.630
just some food.

35:36.360 --> 35:36.960
Right.

35:38.480 --> 35:39.400
There's more.

35:41.320 --> 35:42.760
Since we came to Nanjing,

35:42.760 --> 35:44.840
we haven't sent word home
to let them know we're safe.

35:44.840 --> 35:46.710
Send this letter back too

35:46.710 --> 35:48.570
so they won't be worried about us.

35:48.590 --> 35:50.110
Okay, I'll go right now.

35:53.230 --> 35:53.960
Be careful.

35:53.960 --> 35:54.880
Don't break that.

35:54.880 --> 35:55.320
Okay.

35:55.510 --> 35:57.040
This must be put carefully.

35:57.560 --> 36:01.760
[Luxia Temple, Nanjing]

35:59.640 --> 36:02.640
Master Fahui,
these benefactors are looking for you.

36:03.760 --> 36:05.200
Greetings, Master.

36:05.230 --> 36:06.510
Greetings, Master.

36:09.150 --> 36:11.750
[Zen Master Faci]

36:09.360 --> 36:10.550
Benefactors,

36:11.190 --> 36:13.030
whatever you are asking for,

36:13.110 --> 36:15.920
forgive me, but I cannot help.

36:18.480 --> 36:21.760
Master, we haven't even spoken yet.

36:21.840 --> 36:23.710
How do you know our purpose?

36:26.030 --> 36:28.320
You have ink stains on your hands.

36:28.360 --> 36:30.960
You must be an ink maker.

36:33.670 --> 36:34.880
You are wise, Master.

36:35.650 --> 36:37.180
I am not wise.

36:37.550 --> 36:39.010
It is just that these days,

36:39.190 --> 36:41.630
for the Noble Consort's birthday inkstick,

36:41.630 --> 36:44.150
too many ink makers have come to find me.

36:44.800 --> 36:46.480
Seeing so many of you,

36:46.840 --> 36:48.800
I've figured it out.

36:50.230 --> 36:52.360
Since you already know why we are here,

36:52.480 --> 36:54.190
we won't beat around the bush.

36:54.440 --> 36:57.360
Master, we heard there are scriptures here

36:57.360 --> 36:58.630
that were hand-copied
by the Noble Consort.

36:58.630 --> 37:00.190
Could we take a look?

37:01.960 --> 37:02.840
Master,

37:03.840 --> 37:06.030
this is a treasured palm-leaf sutra
from our family.

37:06.030 --> 37:08.000
We are willing to offer it to the temple

37:08.000 --> 37:09.000
and you.

37:10.510 --> 37:12.710
Though your sincerity is appreciated,

37:13.400 --> 37:15.510
I am not worthy of such a gift.

37:16.000 --> 37:18.880
The Noble Consort did indeed visit
our temple to worship Buddha,

37:18.880 --> 37:21.280
and I have given her Dharma teachings

37:21.280 --> 37:22.630
on a few occasions.

37:22.840 --> 37:24.710
But there are no

37:25.110 --> 37:28.000
hand-copied sutras by her
in Luoxia Temple.

37:28.590 --> 37:31.800
I do not know
where such a rumor came from.

37:34.150 --> 37:37.070
I understand your difficulties, Master.

37:37.510 --> 37:39.000
If we can't see it in person,

37:39.000 --> 37:40.550
could you tell us

37:40.550 --> 37:42.950
about the Noble Consort's writing habits?

37:44.190 --> 37:45.670
Amitabha.

37:46.320 --> 37:48.360
Monks do not lie.

37:48.860 --> 37:49.990
Not only do I not have

37:50.010 --> 37:52.230
the hand-copied sutras
of the Noble Consort,

37:52.230 --> 37:55.000
I have never even seen them.

37:56.590 --> 37:59.070
I advise you

37:59.840 --> 38:02.480
to stop thinking about these sutras.

38:03.190 --> 38:04.720
I heard that half a year ago,

38:04.800 --> 38:06.190
someone in the palace

38:06.190 --> 38:09.440
tried to steal the Noble Consort's
calligraphy to sell for profit.

38:09.440 --> 38:11.110
After being discovered,

38:12.280 --> 38:14.480
they were immediately beaten to death.

38:17.590 --> 38:19.960
Please go back.

38:20.280 --> 38:22.510
I must take my leave.

38:23.550 --> 38:25.080
Thank you for your trouble.

38:28.630 --> 38:30.190
We came all this way

38:30.400 --> 38:32.110
for nothing.

38:33.230 --> 38:34.440
It's okay, Xianglan.

38:34.840 --> 38:36.240
If this way doesn't work,

38:36.360 --> 38:37.760
we'll find another way.

38:37.840 --> 38:39.040
There's always a way.

38:41.890 --> 38:44.370
It looks like it's going to rain.

38:44.400 --> 38:45.710
None of us brought an umbrella.

38:45.710 --> 38:47.320
Let's hurry down the mountain.

38:47.320 --> 38:48.520
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

38:53.760 --> 38:55.000
Please wait.

38:57.150 --> 38:58.360
Wait a moment.

38:58.440 --> 39:00.110
Please take this umbrella

39:00.110 --> 39:02.110
to shelter from the rain on your way.

39:03.150 --> 39:05.150
Thank you for the umbrella, Master.

39:07.190 --> 39:08.480
It is not from me.

39:08.550 --> 39:11.810
This umbrella was given to me
by a benefactor in the temple.

39:12.550 --> 39:13.440
A benefactor?

39:15.110 --> 39:16.230
Who?

39:17.710 --> 39:19.070
Who gave us the umbrella?

39:19.070 --> 39:20.870
Probably a kindhearted person.

39:27.960 --> 39:29.510
Xianglan, wait for me here a moment.

39:29.510 --> 39:30.590
I'll be right back.

39:34.720 --> 39:38.380
[In Memory of the Fallen Soldiers
in the War Against the Japanese]

40:12.840 --> 40:15.360
Master, we saw Miss Li Zhen.

40:15.400 --> 40:17.000
Are we really not going to meet her?

40:17.000 --> 40:18.840
We have our own things to do.

40:19.030 --> 40:20.930
As long as you delivered the umbrella,
it's fine.

40:20.930 --> 40:22.560
You said you wouldn't help,

40:22.590 --> 40:24.440
but secretly had me deliver an umbrella.

40:24.440 --> 40:25.480
You said one thing and did another.

40:25.480 --> 40:26.670
This is a sacred Buddhist place.

40:26.670 --> 40:28.070
Don't talk nonsense.

40:30.150 --> 40:31.150
Qi Jiu.

40:32.560 --> 40:33.370
Miss Li Zhen?

40:39.440 --> 40:40.440
Mr. Xiao.

40:43.880 --> 40:44.920
It really is you.

40:49.150 --> 40:51.810
Didn't you tell me
you wouldn't come to Nanjing?

40:52.070 --> 40:53.510
Why are you here today?

40:55.880 --> 40:57.550
I was indeed tied up before,

40:57.710 --> 41:00.170
but today I'm here
under Marshal Qi's orders

41:00.320 --> 41:02.960
to pray for the soldiers
who died in battle.

41:13.030 --> 41:15.160
You gave me this umbrella, didn't you?

41:15.440 --> 41:16.370
He gave it to you.

41:22.290 --> 41:23.070
It was me.

41:23.400 --> 41:24.480
I gave it to you.

41:29.230 --> 41:30.440
Anyway,

41:30.920 --> 41:31.960
it's a big world,

41:32.140 --> 41:33.160
and for us to meet here

41:33.160 --> 41:34.350
must be fate.

41:39.880 --> 41:41.410
Have you finished praying?

41:42.150 --> 41:43.480
If you have,

41:44.000 --> 41:47.190
why don't you come down the mountain
with me and Xianglan?

41:47.190 --> 41:49.650
Zhengshen and Zhengyou
are here in Nanjing.

41:51.000 --> 41:52.510
How about we get together?

41:57.800 --> 42:00.280
I do have
official business to attend to today,

42:00.280 --> 42:02.810
so I'm afraid
I can't accept your invitation.

42:03.030 --> 42:04.630
My apologies, Manager Zhen.

42:09.440 --> 42:10.170
That's fine.

42:13.800 --> 42:14.880
A while ago, I sent my family

42:14.880 --> 42:16.540
many specialties in Nanjing.

42:17.570 --> 42:19.260
I also sent one to you.

42:19.800 --> 42:20.860
Did you receive it?

42:22.920 --> 42:23.550
No.

42:25.000 --> 42:26.960
I've been away from Huizhou for days.

42:26.960 --> 42:29.000
I didn't receive it.

42:31.670 --> 42:32.430
Alright then.

42:32.430 --> 42:33.150
I won't bother you anymore.

42:33.150 --> 42:35.010
Go ahead and get back to your work.

42:35.280 --> 42:36.030
Farewell.

42:40.630 --> 42:42.320
Then how do I return this umbrella to you?

42:42.320 --> 42:44.550
It's just an umbrella.
Don't worry about it.

42:44.550 --> 42:46.410
It really was you who gave it to me.

42:46.630 --> 42:48.830
You dared to lie to me in front of Buddha?

42:53.320 --> 42:54.030
Here.

42:54.510 --> 42:55.280
I don't need it.
